===Suffix===
{{head|is|suffix}}

# {{n-g|forms verbs from nouns}}
#: {{suffixusex|is|spark|[[sparka|spark'''a''']]|t1=a kick|t2=to kick}}
#: {{suffixusex|is|mjólk|[[mjólka|mjólk'''a''']]|t1=milk|t2=to [[milk]]}}
#: {{suffixusex|is|von|[[vona|von'''a''']]|t1=hope|t2=to [[hope]]}}
#: {{suffixusex|is|ávarp|[[ávarpa|ávarp'''a''']]|t1=an address|t2=to address}}
#: {{suffixusex|is|rit|[[rita|rit'''a''']]|t1=a writ|t2=to write}}
#: {{suffixusex|is|rass|[[rassa|rass'''a''']]|t1=an [[ass]]|t2=to [[spank]] (on the ass)}}
# {{n-g|Used to form adverbs from adjectives.}}
#: {{suffixusex|is|illur|[[illa|ill'''a''']]|t1=[[bad]]|t2=[[badly]]}}

