====Interjection====
{{head|is|interjection}}

# {{lb|is|informal}} [[bye]], [[goodbye]]

=====Usage notes=====
{{m|is|bæ|Bæ}} is a relatively informal greeting, but very common. {{m|is|bless|Bless}} or {{m|is|vertu sæll}} should be used in more formal situations.

The use of {{m|is|hæ}} and {{m|is|bæ}} (corresponding to English {{m|en|hi}} and {{m|en|bye}}) was commonly frowned upon by older speakers well into the 2000s.

