Page 2722 djöfulli: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Derived from the curse word {{m|is|djöfull||devil}} by imitating the endings of the related adverbial curse words {{m|is|andskoti}}, {{m|is|fjandi}}, etc.<ref name=malfar>[http://malfar.arnastofnun.is/grein/737699 Málfarspistill. Jón G. Friðjónsson, 2017-03-04]</ref>  ({{m|is|djöfulli|Djöfulli}} can not be naturally derived from {{m|is|djöfull}} by itself).

Appears in the mid-20th century.<ref name=malfar/>

===Adverb===
{{is-adv}}

# [[darn]], [[damn]] {{gloss|a fairly mild curse word, most often used positively}}
#: {{uxi|is|Þetta er '''djöfulli''' fínt kaffi!|That's some damn good coffee!}}

