|passage=Úr augunum fránu eldur brann<br> af ógnarbræði og heift með sann, <br> svo undarlegt engum þyki: <br> af hræðslu urðu’ allar hetjurnar <br> er hvergi áður sást bregða par,<br> '''„ædru“''' á augnabliki.
|translation=From the keen eyes fire burned<br> with terrible rage and fury, truly,<br> so none will find it strange:<br> out of fear all the heroes<br> that had never before been seen startled at all<br> '''sober''' in the blink of an eye.}}
