===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|is|non|egg}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*ajją}}, from {{inh|is|ine-pro|*h₂ōwyóm}}. Cognate with {{cog|ang|ǣġ}} (obsolete English {{m|en|ey}}); Swedish {{m|sv|ägg}}; {{cog|goh|ei}} (German {{m|de|Ei}}).

