From {{inh|is|non|eiga}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*aiganą}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-preterite|á|átti|átt}}

# to [[have]], to be [[closely]] related to {{+obj|is|acc}}
#: {{usex|is|Ég '''á''' skemmtilega konu.|I '''have''' a funny wife.}}
# to [[possess]], to [[own]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
# to [[have to]], [[should]]
#: {{ux|is|Hann '''á''' að mæta í skólann, sama hvað foreldrar hans segja.|He's '''supposed''' to show up for school, regardless of what his parents say.}}
# to be [[said]] to be by others
#: {{ux|is|''The Matrix'' '''á''' að vera skemmtileg mynd.|'''They say''' ''The Matrix'' is a good movie.}}

