===Etymology===
[[:w:Jón Páll|Jón Páll]] was an Icelandic strongman and the most prominent athlete of the 1980s. He could easily lift heavy objects, thus: "[[easy peasy]] for Jón Páll". The saying gained popularity since it rhymes with the already common expression {{m|is|ekkert mál}}.

===Phrase===
{{head|is|phrase}}

# [[easy peasy]], a [[piece of cake]], extremely easy
