Page 3321 ekki fyrir fimm aura: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|is|ekki fyrir fimmaura}}

===Etymology===
{{lit|not (even) for five cents}}, i.e. it is worthless. Compare {{cog|sv|för fem öre|inte för fem öre}}, {{cog|no|for fem øre|ikke for fem øre}}.

===Phrase===
{{head|is|phrase|head=[[ekki]] [[fyrir]] [[fimm]] [[aur|aura]]}}

# {{lb|is|idiomatic}} not at all, absolutely not
