Page 3411 en: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|en}}. ''the comparative superior conjunction & the hesitational cunjunction have developed seperately into the same form. the comparative cunjunction is -an in the old language, -þan on runestone probably is related to -then, while the other form (hesitational) has formed from the augmentive.
''

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈɛːn/}}
{{rfap|is}}

===Adverb===
{{is-adv}}

# [[how]]
#: {{ux|inline=1|is|Nei, Elín? '''En''' [[gaman að sjá þig]]!|Elín? '''How''' good to see you!}}

===Conjunction===
{{head|is|conjunction}}

# [[but]]
#: {{ux|inline=1|is|Ég drekk kaffi '''en''' ég drekk ekki te.|I drink coffee but I don't drink tea.}}
#: {{ux|inline=1|is|Ég ætla að [[fá]] [[brauð]] '''en''' ekki mjólk.|I'll have bread '''but''' not [[milk]].}}
# [[than]] (with an adjective in the [[comparative]])
#: {{ux|inline=1|is|Ég er [[betri]] '''en''' bróðir minn.|I'm [[better]] '''than''' my brother.}}
#: {{ux|inline=1|is|Hún er skemmtilegri '''en''' ég.|She is more fun '''than''' I am.}}
# {{senseid|is|semicolon}} {{lb|is|formal|_|written language}} {{n-g|used to join closely linked sentences, similar to a [[semicolon]] in English}}
#: ''Rannsókn embættis sérstaks saksóknara á meintum innherjasvikum Baldurs Guðlaugssonar stóð yfir í rúmlega ár, '''en''' FME kærði málið með bréfi til embættisins hinn 9. júlí á síðasta ári.''<ref>{{cite-web |title=Baldur ákærður fyrir innherjasvik og brot í opinberu starfi |url=http://www.visir.is/baldur-akaerdur-fyrir-innherjasvik-og-brot-i-opinberu-starfi-/article/2010914009530%26sp%3D1 |accessdate=25 April 2019 |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20160919093325/http://www.visir.is/baldur-akaerdur-fyrir-innherjasvik-og-brot-i-opinberu-starfi-/article/2010914009530%26sp%3D1 |archivedate=19 September 2016|work=Vísir}}</ref>
# {{n-g|conjunction similar to [[and]]}}
#: {{ux|inline=1|is|Sonur hans hét Jón, '''en''' dóttir hans Ása.|His son was named John and his daughter was named Ása.}}
#: {{ux|inline=1|is|Veðrið var ekki gott [[framan af]]: rigning á fjallinu, '''en''' þoka í byggð.|The weather was not good to begin with: rain in the mountains, and fog in the countryside.}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|is|áður en|betri er krókur en kelda|betur sjá augu en auga|heldur en|fyrr en|nær dauða en lífi|sveltur sitjandi kráka en fljúgandi fær}}

