Page 3569 eyða: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|eyða}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*auþijaną}}. Related to the adjective {{m|non|auðr||empty, barren}} ( > Icelandic {{m|is|auður}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈeiːða/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|eiːða|s=2}}
*: Homophones: {{l|is|eiða}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|eyddi|eytt}}

# to [[destroy]], [[bring to nothing]]
#: ''Allri [[borg]]inni var [[gjörsamlega]] '''eytt''' í [[stríð]]inu.''
#: The entire city was completely '''destroyed''' in the war.
# to [[spend]], [[waste]]
#: '''''Eyddu''' [[ekki]] [[tími|tíma]] þínum í þess háttar [[vitleysa|vitleysu]]!''
#: Don't '''waste''' your time on that sort of nonsense!

====Conjugation====
{{is-conj-w2||ey|ð}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|to destroy}} {{l|is|eyðileggja}}, {{l|is|skemma}}
* {{sense|to waste}} {{l|is|kasta á glæ}}, {{l|is|sóa}}, {{l|is|spandera}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|is|eyðing}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|@@}}

# a [[blank]]
#: ''[[vinsamlega|Vinsamlegast]] [[fylla|fyllið]] í '''eyðurnar'''.''
#: Please fill in the '''blanks'''.

