Referring to drink cartons, this word was adopted to distinguish the newer Tetra Brik and Tetra Rex cartons from the original [[tetrahedral]] [[w:Tetra Pak|Tetra Pak]] packaging (now branded Tetra Classic), called {{m|is|hyrna}}, which had previously been the common container format for milk in Iceland.

