From {{inh|is|non|flóð}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*flōdą}}, a byform of {{m|gem-pro|*flōduz}}.

Cognate with Norwegian, Swedish and Danish {{m|da|flod}}, English {{m|en|flood}}, Dutch {{m|nl|vloed}}, German {{m|de|Flut}}.

