Page 5223 geta: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{root|is|ine-pro|*gʰed-}}
From {{inh|is|non|geta}} (whence also {{cog|en|get}}), from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*getaną}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*gʰed-||take, seize}}. Compare {{cog|da|gide}}, {{cog|sv|gitta}}, {{cog|en|get}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈcɛːta/}}\* {{audio|is|Is-geta.oga}}
* {{rhymes|is|ɛːta|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|gat|gátu|getað/getið}}

# (auxiliary verb) can, to be [[able]] {{+obj|is|sup}}
#: {{ux|is| '''Getur''' þú sagt mér hvar Bláa Lónið er?|'''Can''' you tell me where the [[Blue Lagoon]] is?}}
# to [[father]], to [[beget]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
#* Genesis 5:3 ([http://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Fyrsta%20bók%20Móse+5:3&version=ICELAND Icelandic], [http://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Fyrsta%20b%C3%B3k%20M%C3%B3se%205:3&version=NIV English])
#*: {{quote|is|Adam lifði hundrað og þrjátíu ár. Þá '''gat''' hann son í líking sinni, eftir sinni mynd, og nefndi hann Set.|When Adam had lived 130 years, he '''had''' a son in his own likeness, in his own image; and he named him Seth.}}
# to [[obtain]], [[achieve]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
#: {{ux|is| Maðurinn '''gat''' sér gott orð í Danmörku.|The man '''achieved''' fame in Denmark.}}
# to [[guess]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
#: {{ux|is| Hann '''gat''' rétt.|He '''guessed''' correctly.}}
# to [[mention]] {{+obj|is|gen}}
#: {{ux|is| Hennar er '''getið''' í bók þeirri.|She is '''mentioned''' in that book.}}

====Usage notes====
* Geta (1) requires the supine (sagnbót) form of an accompanying verb, rather than the bare infinitive.
** Incorrect: ''Ég get ekki '''segja''' þér hvers vegna.''
** Correct: ''Ég get ekki '''sagt''' þér hvers vegna.''
*** I cannot tell you why.
* The supine of geta (1) is ''getað'', the supine of geta in all other senses is ''getið''.
** ''Hann hefur ekki '''getað''' talað við son sinn.''
*** He has not been able to speak with his son; he hasn't ''gotten'' to speak with his son".
** ''Hann hefur '''getið''' son.''
*** He has begotten a son.

====Conjugation====
{{is-conj-s5|g|e|t}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|is|eins og hann frekast gat}}
* {{l|is|eins og nærri má geta}}

====See also====
* {{l|is|valda}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|@@}}

# [[ability]]

====Declension====
{{is-ndecl|f}}

[[Category:Most used Icelandic verbs]]
{{cln|is|auxiliary verbs}}

-------- end text --------
