# [[a little]], [[a bit]]; [[fairly]]
#: {{ux|is|Ég er '''hálf'''smeykur við hann.|I'm '''a bit''' afraid of him.}}
# {{lb|is|time}} [[half]]; [[half past|half-past]] the hour before
#: {{ux|is|Ég kem klukkan '''hálf'''sjö.|I'll be there at '''half-past''' six.}}

====Usage notes====
* Often used in adjectives, nouns, and with participles; but rarely in verbs.

====Usage notes====
* Writing compound terms prefixed with {{m|is|hálf-}} as [[hyphen]]ated is allowed (along with {{m|is|all-}}, {{m|is|jafn-}} and {{m|is|lang-}}):<ref>[http://www.rthj.hi.is/solofile/1011143 XIII. Bandstrik] ("hyphens")</ref>
*: ''Hún var '''hálf'''-utan við sig.''
*:: She was '''fairly''' absent-minded.

