# [[leafy liverwort]] of the genus {{taxfmt|Anthelia|genus}}
#* {{quote-journal|is|date=5 February 2006|journal=Morgunblaðið|volume=94|issue=35|page=26|author=Ólaf Örn Haraldsson|title=Þjórsárver og Arnarfell hið mikla|trans-title=Þjórsárver and Great Arnarfell|url=http://timarit.is/view_page_init.jsp?issId=284125&pageId=4121655&lang=is&q=h%E9lumosar|passage=''Gróðurinn sem við sjáum er aðallega móa- og víðiheiðar á þurrari svæðum og mosar og '''hélumosar''' í lægðum, með störum og öðrum votlendisgróðri.''|translation=The vegetation we see is mostly tussock- and willow-heaths in the dry areas and mosses and '''leafy liverworts''' in the hollows, with sedges and other wetland vegetation.}}
#* {{quote-journal|is|year=2011|journal=Náttúrufræðingurinn|volume=81|issue=2|page=87|author=Guðmundur Þorsteinsson|title=Eldur uppi í Snæfellsjökli á 17. öld?|trans-title=Fire up on Snæfellsjökull in the 17th century?|url=http://timarit.is/view_page_init.jsp?issId=384514&pageId=6468803&lang=is&q=h%E9lumosi|passage=''Þar kom fram að þarna vex aðallega '''hélumosi''' og eitthvað af fléttum og þörungum.''|translation=It appeared that mainly '''leafy liverwort''' grows there, and also some lichens and algae.}}
#* {{quote-journal|is|year=2015|journal=Náttúrufræðingurinn|volume=85|issue=3-4|page=159|author=Helgi Hallgrímsson|title=Mosaskorpa|url=http://timarit.is/view_page_init.jsp?issId=392349&pageId=6780542&lang=is&q=h%E9lumosa%20H%E9lumosi|passage=''Auk '''hélumosans''' eru ríkjandi háplöntutegundirnar grasvíðir, kornsúra, lambagras, túnvingull, gendinghnappur, axhæra og fjallasveifgras.''|translation=In addition to the '''leafy liverwort''', the dominant plant species are least willow, Alpine bistort, moss campion, Arctic fescue, ''gendinghnappur'', spiked woodrush and alpine meadow-grass.}}

