====Usage notes====
* '''Hittiðfyrra''' is the spelling recommended by Árnastofnun,<ref>{{cite-web|url=http://malfar.arnastofnun.is/grein/72616|passage=Ritað er hittiðfyrra en ekki „hitteðfyrra“.|work=Málfarsbankin|accessdate=18 November 2021}}</ref> while a column writer for the Morgunblaðið recommends {{m|is|hittifyrra}}.<ref name="mbl">{{cite-web|url=https://www.mbl.is/greinasafn/grein/1554662/|work=mbl.is|year=2015|accessdate=18 November 2021}}</ref> Both are shown in dictionaries alongside {{m|is|hitteðfyrra}}. Other variants in use are {{m|is|hitt í fyrra}} and {{m|is|hittífyrra}}, likely due to influence by {{m|is|í fyrra}}.

