Page 7040 hreinn sveinn: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the [[positive degree]] of the [[adjective]] ''[[hreinn]]'' meaning "[[clean]]" or "[[pure]]" + ''[[sveinn]]'' meaning "[[lad]]". Meaning "clean lad".

