====Usage notes====
* One may legally name one's child "''[[Hreinn#Icelandic|Hreinn]] [[Sveinn#Icelandic|Sveinn]]''" in Iceland - and therefore this name often serves as a cruel but comical example of [[double entendre]] in naming traditions.

