Page 7126 hrossafluga: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{affix|is|hross|gloss1=horse|fluga|gloss2=fly}}. The reason for this nomenclature is uncertain, but some think that it has been given this name either because its feet are reminding of a horse's long legs, or because it has legs which are long and clumsy, like those of a horse (compared to the torso).<ref>{{webofscience|6114|Af hverju kallast hrossafluga þessu nafni?|Why is the ''hrossafluga'' named so?}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈr̥ɔsːaˌflʏːɣa/}}

