===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|hvat}}, originally the neuter form of {{m|non|*hver}} (from {{der|is|gem-pro|*hwaz}}), but conflated with {{m|non|hverr}} (whence Modern Icelandic {{m|is|hver}}). Corresponds to {{der|is|gem-pro|*hwat}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*kʷód}}, {{m|ine-pro|*kʷod}}. See {{m|is|hver}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/kʰvaːð/}}
** {{audio|is|Is-hvað.oga}}
** {{homophones|is|kvað}}
* {{IPA|is|/xʷaːð/|qq=dialectal, now rare}}
* {{rhymes|is|aːð|s=1}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|is|pronoun}}

# [[what]]
#: {{ux|is|'''Hvað''' gerði ég vitlaust?|'''What''' did I do wrong?}}
#: {{ux|is|Eftir '''hverju''' bíðum við?|'''What''' are we waiting for?}}

====Declension====
See {{m|is|hver}}.

