===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|hǫfuð}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*hafudą}} or {{m|gem-pro|*habudą}}, northern form of {{m|gem-pro|*haubudą}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*kauput-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*kaput-||head}}. More at English {{m|en|head}}.

