Page 7835 ítarlegur: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|is|ýtarlegur}}

===Etymology===
Shares a connection with the old adjective {{m|is|ítur||fine, quite good, pretty, splendid}} when spelled with an ''í'',<ref name="vis">{{webofscience|55165|Hvort á að skrifa í eða ý í í/ýtarlega, í/ýtarlegur, til hins í/ýtrasta?|Should I spell ''í/ýtarlega'', ''í/ýtarlegur'' and ''til hins í/ýtrasta'' with an ''í'' or an ''ý''?}}</ref> comes from the {{der|is|da|yderlig}}, compare the {{cog|sv|ytterlig||extreme}} and {{cog|no|ytterlig}}.

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|ítarlegri|ítarlegastur}}

# [[detailed]], [[thorough]], [[in-depth]], [[elaborate]], [[minute]]<ref>{{cite-web|url=http://www.hugtakasafn.utn.stjr.is/hugtak.adp?id=40700|title=ítarlegur|accessdate=10 February 2011|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20160304124718/http://www.hugtakasafn.utn.stjr.is/hugtak.adp?id=40700|archivedate=4 March 2016}}</ref>
# {{lb|is|dated}} [[fine]], [[glorious]], quite [[good]], [[splendid]], [[marvelous]] (confer {{m|is|ýtarlegur}})
#: '''''Ítarlegur''' hilmir.'' {{qualifier|poetic}}
#:: A '''lordly''' king.

====Usage notes====
* May be written as {{m|is|ítarlegur}} and as {{m|is|ýtarlegur}} according to ''Stafsetningarorðabókin'' (“the Book on Orthography”, '''2006''').<ref name="vis"/>

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|thorough}} {{l|is|nákvæmur}}, {{l|is|rækilegur}}, {{l|is|vandlegur}}, {{l|is|gaumgæfnislegur}}
* {{sense|fine, glorious}} {{l|is|fagur}}, {{l|is|dýrlegur}}, {{l|is|ágætur}}

====Derived terms====
{{der-top}}

* {{l|is|ítarlegar hagtölur||comprehensive statistics}}
* {{l|is|ítarlega útfærðar kröfur||detailed requirements}}
