{{is-noun|@@}}

# a [[jeep]], an [[SUV]]
# {{lb|is|slang}} a [[showoff]], someone [[obstreperous]]<ref name="arna" />
# {{lb|is|slang}} a [[rookie]] on a [[fishing]] [[trawler]]<ref name="arna" /><ref>''Orðabók um slangur'' (Mörður Árnason, Svavar Sigmundsson og Örnólfur Thorsson 1982)</ref>

