Page 8238 kasbomm: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{af|is|[[kös|kas-]]<t:heap>|bomm<t:pregnant><pos:informal>}}, where "heap" refers to the spherical properties of the stomach of a pregnant woman.<ref>{{webofscience|7039|Hvað er þetta 'kas' þegar konur eru kasólettar?|What does the ''kas'' in ''kasólettur'' mean?}}</ref>

===Adjective===
{{head|is|adjective}}

# [[highly]] [[pregnant]]
#* ''Spegillinn'' (the Mirror)<ref> http://www2.lexis.hi.is/cgi-bin/ritmal/leitord.cgi?adg=daemi&n=684048&s=300180&l=kasbomm&m=kasbomm</ref>
#*: {{quote|is|Hafið þið ekki heyrt hvernig er ástatt hjá henni frú Jónasínu? Hún er nú bara '''kasbomm''' og maðurinn búinn að vera svona lengi í siglingu.|Have you not heard how things are with miss Jónasína? She is '''notably expecting''' with her husband having been on a sea voyage for so long.}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|highly pregnant}} {{l|is|kasóléttur|g=m}}, {{l|is|kasólétt}} {{g|f|n}}

====See also====
* [[óléttur]] {{g|m}}, [[ólétt]] {{g|f|n}}
* [[þungaður]] {{g|m}}, [[þunguð]] {{g|f}}, [[þungað]] {{g|n}}
* [[barnshafandi]]
* [[ófrískur]] {{g|m}}, [[ófrísk]] {{g|f|n}}
* [[vanfær]] {{g|m|f}}, [[vanfært]] {{g|n}}
* [[barna]]

====References====
<references/>
-------- end text --------
