Page 8603 klukkan: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{lit|the clock}}.

===Phrase===
{{head|is|phrase}}

# at [[o'clock]], [[o'clock]]
#: ''Ég [[koma|kem]] [[klukkan þrjú|'''klukkan''' þrjú]].''
#:: I'll [[be there]] '''at''' [[three o'clock|three '''o'clock''']].
#: '''''[[klukkan fimm|Klukkan]]''' er '''[[klukkan fimm|fimm]]'''.''
#:: It's [[five o'clock|five '''o'clock''']].
# the [[time]]
#: ''[[hvað er klukkan|Hvað er '''klukkan''']]?''
#:: [[what time is it|What's the '''time''']]?
#: '''''Klukkan''' er [[kortér]] [[yfir]] [[þrír|þrjú]].''
#:: '''The time''' is [[quarter]] [[past]] [[three]].

====Usage notes====
* Always follow by the time in [[neuter]]:
*: [[klukkan eitt|'''klukkan''' eitt]] — [[one o'clock|one '''o'clock''']]
*: [[klukkan tvö|'''klukkan''' tvö]] — [[two o'clock|two '''o'clock''']]
*: [[klukkan þrjú|'''klukkan''' þrjú]] — [[three o'clock|three '''o'clock''']]
*: [[klukkan fjögur|'''klukkan''' fjögur]] — [[four o'clock|four '''o'clock''']]
*: [[klukkan fimm|'''klukkan''' fimm]] — [[five o'clock|five '''o'clock''']]
*: [[klukkan sex|'''klukkan''' sex]] — [[six o'clock|six '''o'clock''']]
*: [[klukkan sjö|'''klukkan''' sjö]] — [[seven o'clock|seven '''o'clock''']]
*: [[klukkan átta|'''klukkan''' átta]] — [[eight o'clock|eight '''o'clock''']]
*: [[klukkan níu|'''klukkan''' níu]] — [[nine o'clock|nine '''o'clock''']]
*: [[klukkan tíu|'''klukkan''' tíu]] — [[ten o'clock|ten '''o'clock''']]
*: [[klukkan ellefu|'''klukkan''' ellefu]] — [[eleven o'clock|eleven '''o'clock''']]
*: [[klukkan tólf|'''klukkan''' tólf]] — [[twelve o'clock|twelve '''o'clock''']]

====See also====
* [[Appendix:Telling time in Icelandic]]
-------- end text --------
