Page 8759 konungur: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{root|is|ine-pro|*ǵenh₁-}}
From {{inh|is|non|konungr}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*kuningaz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈkʰɔːnuŋkʏr/|[ˈkʰoɔ̯ːnuŋkʉ̞r̥]}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|@@}}

# A [[king]]; the male ruler of a sovereign nation, usually one who inherits his position through right of birth.
#: {{syn|is|alvaldur|fylkir|hersir|hilmir|jöfur|kóngur|lofðungur|niflungur}}
#: {{ux|is|Kristján X var síðasti — og eini — '''konungur''' Íslands, þrátt fyrir nafnið sitt.|Kristján X was the last — and only — '''king''' of Iceland, despite his name.}}

