Page 10153 m/: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Adapted from {{bor|is|da|m/}}, abbreviating {{m|da|med||with}}, and/or from its probable source, {{der|is|de|m/}}, abbreviating {{m|de|mit||with}}.

