===Preposition===
{{head|is|preposition}}

# [[among]], [[amongst]] {{+obj|is|gen}}
#: ''Ég er '''meðal''' [[mikilmaður|mikilmenna]].''
#:: I am '''amongst''' great men.

===Adverb===
{{is-adv}}

# [[average]]

====Usage notes====
Usually always written as a prefix ({{m|is|meðal-}}), but often written separately when the following word is long ({{m|is||meðal fótboltamaður}}) although such usage is proscribed.

May in informal speech stand by itself ({{m|is||Ég er bara meðal.|I'm just average.}}).

{{cln|is|prepositions that govern the genitive}}
