From {{inh|is|non|mega}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*maganą}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*magʰ-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*megʰ-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈmeiːɣa/}}
* {{rhymes|is|eiːɣa|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-preterite|má|mátti|mátt}}

# to be [[allowed]], to be [[permitted]], to [[may]] {{+obj|is|&intransitive/acc}}
#: {{syn|is|hafa leyfi til}}
#: {{ux|is|Þú '''mátt''' þetta ekki.|inline=1|You''''re''' not '''allowed''' to do that.}}
#: {{ux|is|Hvað '''má''' bjóða ykkur að borða?|inline=1|What '''may''' offer you to eat?}}
# {{lb|is|intransitive}} [[must]], to [[have to]]
#: {{syn|is|verða}}
# to have the [[strength]], to be [[able]]
#: {{syn|is|megna}}

====Conjugation====
{{is-conj-preterite|m|e|g|imp=-}}

====Derived terms====
