|mega ekki hugsa til
|{{l|is|mega ekki vamm sitt vita|t=to be concerned about one's reputation}}
|mega lengi lifa
|{{l|is|mega sín ekki við|t=to not [[manage]] something}}
|mega sín mikils
|{{l|is|mega sín mikils|t=have a lot of [[influence]], to be [[powerful]]}}
|{{l|is|mega til|t=to must, to have to}}
|mega vera að
|{{l|is|mega vera að|t=to have the time to do}}
}}

