# to [[confront]], to [[face]] {{+obj|is|dat}}
#: {{ux|is|[[við|Við]] '''mætum''' [[óvinur|óvininum]] [[við#Icelandic|við]] [[dögun]]!|[[we|We]] '''face''' our [[enemy]] at [[dawn]]!}}
# {{lb|is|intransitive}} to [[turn up]], to [[show up]], to [[come]], to [[appear]]
