* {{l|is|Niflhel||the dark abode of the being [[w:Hel (being)|Hel]]}} {{q|poetic}}
* {{l|is|niflungur||a king, a head of state}} {{q|poetic}}
* {{l|is|Niflungar||[[w:en:Nibelung|Nibelung]]}}
* {{l|is|niflvegur||a dark road}} {{q|poetic}}

