#: {{uxi|is|Við vorum '''perluvinir''' alla barnæskuna.|We were [[BFF]]s during most of our childhood.}}
# {{lb|is|by extension}} people who get along really well with each other {{gloss|often describing a temporary situation}}
#: {{uxi|is|Þeir voru engir '''perluvinir'''.|They didn't exactly get along.}}
#: {{uxi|is|Á meðan leiknum stendur erum við '''perluvinir'''.|During the game we get along really well.}}

====Usage notes====
This term can not be used in the singular, nor can it be used describe a group knowing someone else ("They are my good friends"), it can only be used to describe a group of people knowing each other ("All of them are good friends").

