Page 12894 -ræður: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|is|non|-rǿðr}}. Underwent an [[apophony]] (substitution of one root vowel for another) from the suffix {{m|is|-rað}} in {{m|is|hundrað|hund'''rað'''|a hundred}}.<ref name="etym">[[w:is:Ásgeir Blöndal Magnússon|Ásgeir Blöndal Magnússon]]. Page '''785''' of the [[w:is:Íslensk orðsifjabók|Íslensk orðsifjabók]] (Book of Icelandic Etymology). Publisher: [[w:is:Stofnun Árna Magnússonar á Íslandi|Stofnun Árna Magnússonar á Íslandi]] ([[w:Árni Magnússon Institute for Icelandic Studies|Árni Magnússon Institute for Icelandic Studies]]), first print 1989 ({{ISBN|978-9979-654-01-8}})</ref> Compare the Icelandic {{m|is|hundrað}}, Latin {{m|la|ratiō||reason, calculation}}, {{m|la|reor||I reckon, calculate; I think, deem, judge}} and {{m|la|ratus||established, authoritative; fixed, certain}}.<ref name="etym" />

====Alternative forms====
* {{qualifier|dated, archaic}} {{alt|is|-rœður}}, {{alt|is|-rœðr}}<ref name="etym" />

====Suffix====
{{head|is|suffix|feminine|-ræð|neuter|-rætt|comparative|-ræðari|superlative|-ræðastur}}

# of [[age]], [[height]] or [[depth]]
#: {{afex|is|átta<t:eight>|áttræður<t:eighty years old>}}
# of [[height]] or [[depth]]
#: {{afex|is|tólf<t:twelve>|tólfræður}}

