===Etymology 1===
{{root|is|ine-pro|*sent-|id=go}}

From {{inh|is|non|sinn}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*sinþaz||journey, way; time, occurrence}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*sent-||to head for, go}}. Cognate with {{cog|fo|sinn}}, {{cog|da|sinde}}, {{cog|sv||sin}} (in {{m|sv|någonsin||ever; at any time}}); more distantly {{cog|got|𐍃𐌹𐌽𐌸𐍃}}, {{cog|goh|sind}}.

====Noun====
