Page 13935 skíta upp á bak: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{lit|to shit up onto one's back}}. {{m|is|skíta á sig|Skíta á sig|to shit in one's pants}} may be used to refer to making a [[blunder]]. This phrase takes that analogy further and describes having such an extremely explosive shit (i.e. a blunder) that the fecal matter ends up on one's back.

===Verb===
{{is-verb}}

# {{lb|is|vulgar|colloquial}} to do absolutely [[horrible|horribly]]; to fail horribly; to make a terrible and embarrassing [[mistake]]
#: {{uxi|is|Ég '''skeit upp á bak''' í þessu prófi.|I did absolutely terrible on this test.}}
#: {{uxi|is|Borgarstjórn '''skeit upp á bak''' með því að fara ekki strax í [[framkvæmd|framkvæmdir]].|The city council made an absolutely terrible mistake by not executing the projects immediately.}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|is|skíta á sig}}
* {{l|is|klúðra}}
* {{l|is|hörmulega|ganga hörmulega}}
* {{l|is|með allt niður um sig}}
-------- end text --------
