Page 14109 skrýtinn: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|is|skrítinn}}

===Etymology===
The origin of this and related words ({{m|is|skrýtilegur}}, {{m|is|skrýtilyrði}}, {{m|is|skrýtla}}) is uncertain. The original stem vowel is uncertain, as the phonetic merger of ''í'' and ''ý'' predates their earliest attestation in Icelandic. If the ''ý'' is original, it may be related to {{cog|no|skryten||scrawny}}, dialectal {{cog|sv|skryten}}, {{m|sv|skruten}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|[ˈskriːtɪn(ː)]}}
*: {{rhymes|is|iːtɪn}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|skrýtnari|skrýtnastur}}

# [[weird]]
#: {{ux|is|Þetta eru '''skrýtnir''' tímar.|These are '''strange''' times.}}
#: {{ux|is|Mér var alltaf strítt fyrir að vera '''skrýtni''' krakkinn.|I was always teased for being the '''weird''' kid.}}
# [[funny]]

====Declension====
{{is-decl-adj-1|skr|ý|t|i|n}}

