Page 14339 smali: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=is}}
{{wikipedia|Smalamál|lang=is}}
{{wikipedia|Fjárhirðir|lang=is}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|smali||livestock}}. In the sense “herdsman” (attested since the 17th century<ref name="rms">[https://web.archive.org/web/20160413220305/http://lexis.hi.is/cgi-bin/ritmal/leitord.cgi?adg=velja&n=436117&s=540078 “smali”] in Ritmálssafn Orðabókar Háskólans. Árni Magnússon Institute for Icelandic Studies. Retrieved November 15, 2017.</ref><ref name="onp">[http://onpweb.nfi.sc.ku.dk/webart/s/sm/73036art.htm “smali“] in Ordbog over det norrøne prosasprog. University of Copenhagen. Retrieved November 15, 2017.</ref>) the word is a shortening of {{m|is|smalamaður||herdsman}}, which is derived from this word in the sense “livestock”. The sense “assembler” is derived from the “herdsman” sense, being a poetic translation of English {{m|en|assembler}}. Ultimately derived from the adjective {{m|non|smalr||small}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*smalaz}}, referring originally to smaller livestock, such as sheep and goats. Compare {{cog|de|Schmalvieh||small livestock}}.<ref name="abm">{{R:is:Íslensk orðsifjabók|smali}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈsmaːlɪ/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|aːlɪ|s=2}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|@@}}

# {{lb|is|obsolete|collective}} [[livestock]]
# [[herder]], [[herdsman]]
# {{lb|is|figurative}} someone who gathers people for an event, such as voting
# {{lb|is|computing}} [[assembler]] ([[compiler]] for [[assembly language]])

====Declension====
{{is-ndecl|m}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|herdsman}} {{l|is|hirðir}}, {{l|is|smalamaður}}

====Derived terms====
{{rel-top|Terms derived from sense “livestock”}}
* {{l|is|búsmali}}
{{rel-bottom}}

{{rel-top|Terms derived from sense “herdsman”}}
* {{l|is|smala-}}
* {{l|is|smalamennska}}
* {{l|is|smalareið}}
* {{l|is|smalaleið}}
* {{l|is|smalaslóð}}
* {{l|is|smalaþýða}}
{{rel-bottom}}

{{rel-top|Terms derived from sense “assembler”}}
* {{l|is|smalamál||assembly language}}
* {{l|is|baksmali}}
* {{l|is|eiginlegur smali}}
* {{l|is|fjölvasmali}}
* {{l|is|tilfærslusmali}}
* {{l|is|verktökusmali}}
* {{l|is|örsmali}}
{{rel-bottom}}

{{rel-top|Terms derived from other meanings}}
* {{l|is|hengja smala}}
* {{l|is|hengja smalann}}
{{rel-bottom}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|is|smal}}
* {{l|is|smala||to gather, to round up sheep; to assemble}}

====See also====
