Page 15497 svínvirka: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Composed of {{com|is|svín-|virka}}. Although the literal meaning is “works like a pig”, “svín-” is here a prefix that is used for emphasis, a practice borrowed from {{bor|is|da|svine-}} (e.g. {{m|da|svineheld}}). Compare also {{cog|de|Schweine-}} (e.g. {{m|de|schweinekalt||very cold}}) and other prefixes such as {{noncognate|is|hundleiðinlegur}}.

===Verb===
{{is-verb}}

# to [[work like a charm]], to work very well {{gloss|for solving an issue}}
#: {{uxi|is|Takk, þetta '''svínvirkar'''.|Thanks, works like a charm.}}
-------- end text --------
