====Usage notes====
This term is spelled to match the pronunciation of {{m|is|svolítið}}. Along with the more informal spelling {{m|is|soldið}}, it is sometimes used in books and newspaper columns to give the text a slightly [[folksy]] feel. However, it is not considered too informal nor a misspelling as such.

