# {{lb|is|in compounds}} {{non-gloss|an [[agent noun]] for {{m|is|sitja}} and its compounds or otherwise denoting someone who sits, waits or is situated}}; [[sitter]]
#: E.g. {{m|is|fyrirsæta||model}}, i.e. “one who models/poses”, from {{m|is|sitja fyrir||to pose, model}}

