# to be of a specified degree, duration or amount {{+obj|is|dat}}
#: {{usex|is|svo vikum sætir|for weeks on end}}
# to [[stack]] hay; make it into a [[haystack]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
#* {{quote-book|is|author=Þorvaldur Thoroddsen|title=Lýsing Íslands|url=https://runeberg.org/lysingisl/|location=Copenhagen|publisher=Hið íslenzka Bókmentafélag|year=1919|volume=3|page=133|pageurl=https://runeberg.org/lysingisl/3/0151.html|passage=Í Frey XI, 1914, bls. 46–48, er stungið upp á að '''sæta''' hey á grindum til þess að verja heyið jarðraka og svo vel blási undir það.|translation=In ''Freyr'' (a publication) vol. XI, 1914, pp. 46–48, it is suggested that hay be '''stacked''' on lattices in order to protect the hay from ground moisture and so that there is a good breeze under it.}}

