#*: {{quote|is|Slái þig einhver á kinnina, skaltu og bjóða hina, og '''taki''' einhver yfirhöfn þína, skaltu ekki varna honum að taka kyrtilinn líka.|If someone strikes you on one cheek, turn to him the other also. If someone '''takes''' your cloak, do not stop him from taking your tunic.}}
#: {{ux|is|Ég ætla að '''taka''' bílinn.|I'm going to '''take''' the car.}}
#: {{ux|is|Hún var að fara að '''taka''' veskið þitt!|She was about to '''take''' your purse!}}
# to [[seize]], to [[capture]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
# to [[take]] (time, measure) {{+obj|is|acc}}
#: {{ux|is|Viltu að ég '''taki''' tímann?|Do you want me to '''take''' the time?}}
# to [[get]], to [[obtain]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
# to take {{gloss|undergo}}, e.g. an exam {{+obj|is|acc}}
# to [[accept]], to [[take]] {{+obj|is|acc/dat}}
# to [[hold]], to [[contain]], to [[take]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
#: {{ux|is|Völlurinn '''tekur''' tíu þúsund áhorfenda.|The stadium '''holds''' ten thousand spectators.}}

