===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|is|non|tala}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*talō|t=calculation, number}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*del-|t=to reckon, count}}.

Cognate with {{cog|nl|taal|t=language, speech}}, {{cog|en|tale|t=number}} (from {{cog|enm|-}}, from {{cog|ang|talu|t=calculation; story}}), {{cog|de|Zahl|t=number, figure}}, {{cog|da|tale|t=speech}}, {{cog|la|dolus|t=guile, deceit, fraud}}, {{cog|grc|δόλος|t=wile, bait}}, {{cog|xcl|տող|t=row}}. Related to [[tell]], [[talk]].

