Page 15869 tengja: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|tengja}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*tangijaną|*tangija-|t=to pinch together}}, directly cognate with {{cog|ang|tengan|t=to press, hasten}}. The Proto-Germanic is from {{inh|is|ine-pro|*donḱéyeti|*donḱ-éye-}}, a form also inherited by {{cog|sa|दँशयति|t=to make bite}}. This is a causative to the root {{der|is|ine-pro|*denḱ-|t=to bite}}, cf. {{cog|gem-pro|*tinhaną|*tingan-|t=to press upon}}.<ref>{{R:es:Roberts:2014}}</ref><ref>{{R:ine:LIV|page=118}}</ref> Related to {{m|is|töng|t=pincers}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈtʰeiɲca/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|eiɲca|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|tengdi|tengt}}

