Page 16339 túnvingull: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{af|is|tún|vingull|t1=hayfield|t2=fescue}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈtʰunˌviŋkʏtl/}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|@@}}

# {{vern|Arctic fescue}} ({{taxlink|Festuca richardsonii|species}})
#* {{quote-journal|is|date=9 February 1863|journal=Íslendingur|volume=3|issue=18|page=137|url=http://timarit.is/view_page_init.jsp?issId=138660&pageId=2038962&lang=is&q=t%FAnvingul|passage=''Sumt af þvi, sem jeg hef sljettað, hef jeg sljettað með plógnum eingöngu, plægt um þýfið eins og það kom fyrir, snúið niður grasrótinni, og sáð í flagið smæru og '''túnvingul'''.''|translation=Some of what I have levelled, I have levelled with the plough only, ploughed the tussocky ground as it happened, turned over the grass roots, and sown clovers and '''Arctic fescue''' in the stripped ground.}}
#* {{quote-journal|is|date=13 January 1995|journal=Dagblaðið Vísir|title=Ýmsar grastegundir|volume=85/21|issue=11|page=37|url=http://timarit.is/view_page_init.jsp?issId=195849&pageId=2723499&lang=is&q=rau%F0vingull|passage=''Á Íslandi er '''túnvingull''' algengasta grastegundin, ef með er talinn rauðvingull, sem stundum telst til sömu tegundar.''|translation=In Iceland, '''Arctic fescue''' is the most common grass species, if red fescue is also counted, which is sometimes considered to be the same species.}}
#* {{quote-journal|is|year=2015|journal=Náttúrufræðingurinn|volume=85|issue=3-4|page=159|author=Helgi Hallgrímsson|title=Mosaskorpa|url=http://timarit.is/view_page_init.jsp?issId=392349&pageId=6780542&lang=is&q=h%E9lumosa%20H%E9lumosi|passage=''Auk hélumosans eru ríkjandi háplöntutegundirnar grasvíðir, kornsúra, lambagras, '''túnvingull''', gendinghnappur, axhæra og fjallasveifgras.''|translation=In addition to the leafy liverwort, the dominant plant species are least willow, Alpine bistort, moss campion, '''Arctic fescue''', ''gendinghnappur'', spiked woodrush and alpine meadow-grass.}}

====Declension====
{{is-ndecl|@v}}

