* {{l|is|skipta í tvennt||to divide into two}}
* {{l|is|tvenna}}
* {{l|is|tvennd}}
* {{l|is|tvenning}}
* {{l|is|tvenns konar||of two different kinds, two different kinds}}
*: Með '''tvenns konar''' menningu.
*:: '''''Bicultural'''.''

