* This word was replaced during Iceland's shift to Christianity by {{m|is|þriðjudagur}}, which means simply "[[third]] day". It is now considered archaic, but may be used jocularly or by some revivalists.

====Declension====
{{is-ndecl|@d}}

{{C|is|Days of the week}}
