Page 16497 ugla: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|ugla||owl}} (compare {{cog|sv|uggla}}, {{cog|da|ugle}}), from {{der|is|gem-pro|*uwwalǭ}} (compare {{cog|en|owl}}, {{cog|nl|uil}}, {{cog|fy|ûle}}, {{cog|de|Eule}}), diminutive of {{m|gem-pro|*uwwǭ}} ‘eagle-owl’ (compare {{cog|de|Uhu}}), of {{onomatopoeic|is|title=imitative}} origin or a variant of {{m|gem-pro|*ūfaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*ūfǭ}} (compare {{cog|sv|uv}} ‘horned owl’, Bavarian {{m|bav|Auf}}), from {{der|is|ine-pro|*up-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈʏkla/}}
* {{rhymes|is|ʏkla|s=2}}
*: Homophones: {{l|is|Ugla}}

