From {{inh|is|non|ummál}}. See the Old Norse {{m|non|ummæli}} (Icelandic {{m|is|ummæli}}). Compare the {{cog|is|um||around}} + {{m|is|mál||measurement}} and {{m|is|mæla||measure}}.

===Noun===
{{is-noun|@@}}

# {{lb|is|mathematics}} a [[perimeter]]; {{gloss|sum of the distance of all the lengths of the sides of an object}}
# {{lb|is|mathematics}} a [[circumference]]; {{gloss|length of a line that bounds a circle or other two-dimensional figure}}

