Page 16748 úllen dúllen doff: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=is}}

===Etymology===
The start of a common children's counting-out game. Likely from a Danish rhyme ("ullen dullen dof"). Assumed to be a distortion of the [[Latin]] numerals {{m|lt|unum||one}} and {{m|lt|duo||two}}.<ref>''Svenska folklekar och danser'', 1948.</ref>

===Phrase===
