===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|is|non|vella}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*wallijǭ}}, perhaps also partly from a {{m|gem-pro|*wellǭ}}.

====Noun====
{{is-noun|@@}}

# [[boil]], boiling, [[bubble|bubbling]]
# milk that has been boiled until it curdles and forms a reddish thick substance similar to [[whey cheese]]
# a stifling heat
# the sound made by a [[whimbrel]]
# [[chatter]]
# [[flattery]]
# [[weakling]]
# a small portion (e.g. of [[coffee]])
