===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|is|non|verr}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*weraz}}, from {{inh|is|ine-pro|*wiHrós}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|were-}}.

====Noun====
{{is-noun|@@:man}}

# {{lb|is|poetic|literary}} [[husband]]
#: {{syn|is|bóndi|eiginmaður|ektamaður|maður}}
