Page 17434 vinna: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈvɪnːa/}}
* {{rhymes|is|ɪnːa|s=2}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|is|non|vinna}}.

====Noun====
{{is-noun|@@}}

# a [[job]], an [[occupation]], an [[employment]]
#: {{ux|is|''Að [[hafa vinnu|hafa '''vinnu''']].''|To be '''employed'''.}}
# [[work]], [[labour]]

=====Declension=====
{{is-ndecl|f.sg}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{sense|employment}} {{l|is|atvinna}}
* {{sense|labour}} {{l|is|verk}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|is|hafa vinnu}}
* {{l|is|heimavinna}}
* {{l|is|erfiðisvinna}}
* {{l|is|vinnuhlé}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|is|non|vinna}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*winnaną}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*wenh₁-||to strive, wish, desire, love}}. Related to {{cog|fo|vinna}}, {{cog|sv|vinna}}, {{cog|nb|vinne}}, {{cog|en|win}}, {{cog|nl|winnen}}, and {{cog|de|gewinnen}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-strong|vann|unnu|unnið}}

# {{lb|is|intransitive}} to [[work]], to [[labour]]
#: {{ux|is|''Ég nenni ekki að '''vinna'''.''|I don't want to '''work'''.}}
#: {{ux|is|''Ég '''vinn''' allan daginn.''|I '''work''' all day.}}
# to [[do]], to [[perform]] (e.g. a task) {{+obj|is|acc}}
# {{lb|is|intransitive}} to [[win]], to achieve [[victory]]
#: {{ux|is|''Ég '''vann'''!''|I '''won'''!}}
# to [[win]], to [[triumph]] in (e.g. a game) {{+obj|is|acc}}
#: {{ux|is|''Við '''unnum''' keppnina.''|We '''won''' the tournament.}}
# to [[conquer]], to [[beat]], to [[defeat]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
#: {{ux|is|''Fjölnismenn '''unnu''' Val 2–1 í gær.''|[[w:Ungmennafélagið Fjölnir|Fjölnir]] '''beat''' [[w:Valur Football Club|Valur]] 2–1 yesterday.}}
# to [[win]], to [[obtain]], to [[get]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
#: {{ux|is|''Herinn '''vann''' borgina frá uppreisnarmönnunum.''|The army '''took''' the city from the rebels.}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{is-conj-s3|v|i|nn}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{sense|to work, to labour}} {{l|is|starfa}}
* {{sense|to do, to perform}} {{l|is|framkvæma}}
* {{sense|to win, to achieve victory}} {{l|is|sigra}}
* {{sense|to conquer}} {{l|is|sigra}}
* {{sense|to win, to obtain}} {{l|is|fá}}

[[Category:Most used Icelandic verbs]]

-------- end text --------
