Page 17852 þankastrik: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{compound|is|þanki|t1=thought|strik|t2=line, stroke}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈθauŋ̊kaˌstrɪːk/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|ɪːk}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|@@}}

# {{lb|is|typography}} an [[em dash]], the symbol “'''[[—]]'''” {{gloss|used to [[demarcate]] a [[parenthetical]] thought or to indicate a [[break]], or for [[emphasis]]}}

====Usage notes====
* Used to demarcate opposites, unexpected or sudden changed in narrative; an insertion, a comment or an addition that is to emphasized.<ref name="hi">[https://web.archive.org/web/20100725125453/http://notendur.hi.is/eirikur/greinreg.htm#18gr ''18. gr. Auglýsing um greinarmerkjasetningu''] (“Article 18, Notice of Punctuation Formatting”)</ref><ref name="ritr">[http://wayback.vefsafn.is/wayback/20051101130230/www.sogufelag.is/timarit/timarit_ritreglur.htm ''Leiðbeiningar fyrir höfunda greina, viðhorfa og sjónrýni í Sögu''] (“Guidelines for Authors of Articles, Opinion Pieces and Visual Analysis in ''Saga''”)</ref>
* They are to be separated from the text by one space (“ ”)<ref name="hi"/><ref name="ritr"/><ref>[http://wayback.vefsafn.is/wayback/20100809211118/font.is/2007/06/umbrot-thankastrik-bandstrik-og-skiptistrik/ ''Þankastrik, band strik og skiptistrik''] (“The Em Dash, En Dash and Hyphen”)</ref>—this is different from English where spaces normally neither follow nor precede an em dash.

====Declension====
{{is-ndecl|@s}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|em dash}} {{l|is|m-strik}}<ref>{{cite-web|title=Íslenskt mál og almenn málfræði|url=http://fraedi.is/xn--mlfri-xqa2b6e/leidbein.pdf|accessdate=23 September 2010|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20110929111920/http://fraedi.is/xn--mlfri-xqa2b6e/leidbein.pdf|archivedate=29 September 2011}}</ref>

====Derived terms====
* {{l|is|stutt þankastrik||an en dash}}

====See also====
* {{l|is|brotinn}}, {{l|is|brota-||dashed}}
* {{l|is|brotin lína||a dashed line}}
* {{l|is|morsstrik||a Morse dash}}
* {{l|is|strika- og punktalína||dash and dotted line}}
* {{l|is|tilstrik}}, {{l|is|stutt þankastrik||an en dash}}

===References===
<references/>
-------- end text --------
