''{{cog|gem}} cognates:'' {{cog|osx|þennian}}, {{cog|goh|dennen}} ({{cog|de|dehnen}}), {{cog|frk|*thinsan}}, {{cog|non|þenja}} ({{cog|no|tenja}}).

''{{cog|ine}} cognates:'' {{cog|grc|τείνω}}, {{cog|la|tendere}} ({{cog|fr|tendre}}), {{cog|cel-pro|*tantā}} ({{cog|cy|tant||string of a musical instrument}}, {{cog|sga|tét||cord, rope}}), {{cog|sla-pro|*teneto||net, snare}} ({{cog|ru|тенёто}}), {{cog|bat-pro|*tin-}} ({{cog|lt|tìnti}}).

===Pronunciation===
