Page 18471 ætla: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{inh+|is|non|ætla}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*ahtilōną|t=to strive, think}}. Cognate with {{cog|sv|ättla}}, {{cog|gmq-oda|ætle}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈaihtla/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|aihtla|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|ætlaði|ætlað}}

# to [[intend]], to [[plan]], to [[mean]] to, be [[going to]]
#: {{ux|is|Ég '''ætlaði''' ekki að særa þig.|I didn't '''mean''' to hurt you.}}
#: {{ux|is|Hún '''ætlaði''' alltaf að passa upp á hann.|She was always '''going to''' keep an eye on him.}}
#: {{ux|is|Hættu þessu, asninn þinn! Ég '''ætlaði''' að sitja þarna!|Stop that, you idiot! I was '''going''' to sit there!}}
# to intend to [[go]]
#: {{ux|is|Ég '''ætla''' heim!|I'm '''going''' home!}}
# {{lb|is|of inanimate things, happenings, etc.|or|impersonal}} to be [[going to]], seem to be going to (indicating a likely course of events)
#: {{ux|is|það '''ætlar''' að rigna|it '''looks like it’s going''' to rain}}
# to [[think]], to [[believe]], [[suppose]], be of the opinion (that)
#: {{ux|is|Farið er að skýja, og '''ætla''' ég að fljótlega byrji að rigna.|It is getting cloudy, and I '''think''' it will soon start raining.}}
# to [[believe]], to [[suppose]], to [[attribute]] {{+obj|is|dat<of/to someone> + acc<something>/:að(infinitive)<to do something>}}
#: {{ux|is|'''Ætlaðu''' mér ekki slíka heimsku.|Don’t '''think''' I’m that stupid.|lit=Don’t '''suppose''' such stupidity of me.}}
# to [[intend]] {{+obj|is|dat<for someone> + acc<something>/:að(infinitive)<to do something>}}
#: {{ux|is|Hann '''ætlaði''' henni að annað hlutverk.|He '''intended''' another role for her.}}
#: {{ux|is|Fjölskylda hans '''ætlaði''' honum að leggja stund á lögfræði.|His family '''intended''' for him to study law.}}
# {{lb|is|impersonal|used in the present subjunctive with a subclause, also in the subjunctive}} to [[wonder]], to [[suppose]]
#: {{ux|is|Hvað '''ætli''' forsetinn sé að gera núna?|I '''wonder''' what the president is doing now.}}
#: {{ux|is|Átt þú ekki að vera í skólanum?'' — '''''Ætli''' það ekki.|Aren't you supposed to be at school? — I '''suppose''' so.}}

====Usage notes====
* The verb ''ætla'' is an [[auxiliary verb]] much used in Icelandic.
*: {{ux|is|Ég '''ætla''' að fara í [[bíó]].|I am going (I '''intend''' to go) to the [[cinema]].}}
* Also used to ask for something in stores or restaurants.
*: {{ux|is|Ég '''ætla''' að fá eina [[kók]].|I'll have one Coke. (I '''intend''' to have one [[Coke]].)}}

====Conjugation====
{{is-conj-w4||æ|tl}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|intend}} {{l|is|hafa í hyggju}}
* {{sense|think, believe}} {{l|is|telja}}, {{l|is|álíta}}

====Derived terms====
{{der-top}}
